  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider a badminton racket with length scales as shown in the figure.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0116_3c56f9235bf0.png\" style=\"width: 387px; height: 247px;\" /></p><p>If the mass of the linear and circular portions of the badminton racket are same (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math>) and the mass of the threads are negligible, the moment of inertia of the racket about an axis perpendicular to the handle and in the plane of the ring at, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> distance from the end <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;of the handle will be ______<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>.</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "52",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>r</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>169</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>171</mn><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>37</mn><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>208</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>"
